OL,3,GNEWSAMum fights on for inquiry after
OL,4,Adaughter's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoy Dove has spent years campaigning
OL,7,Ffor answers after the death of her
OL,8,Fdisabled daughter Jodey Whiting who
OL,9,Ftook her own life after her benefits
OL,10,Fwere stopped. Despite other devastating
OL,11,Ffamily losses, Dove is fighting on for
OL,12,Fa public inquiry.
OL,14,FFor Dove, 72, a letter from Sir Stephen
OL,15,FTimms dated 12 October, is another
OL,16,Fchapter in a campaign that has come to
OL,17,Fdefine much of her life since her
OL,18,Fdaughter died in 2017.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
