OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum fights on for inquiry after
OL,4,Adaughter's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Minister for Social Security and
OL,7,FDisability sets out changes the
OL,8,FDepartment for Work and Pensions (DWP)
OL,9,Fsays it has made to improve support for
OL,10,Fvulnerable benefit claimants, following
OL,11,Fher daughter's death, aged 42.
OL,13,FHowever, Dove, from Stockton-on-Tees,
OL,14,Fsays "it is still happening" to other
OL,15,Fvulnerable people and more than eight
OL,16,Fyears on, she is calling for greater
OL,17,Faccountability from the DWP.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
